  "desc": "Harvested from the stage wah scene: syncopated 16th funk line in D dorian over a i-IV vamp (Dm7-G7), with lpenv auto-wah squelch on every note. Base cutoff drifts over 32 cycles under the envelope; whole line lifts an octave every 8th cycle. Peak adds octave pops and a 32nd flurry each 4-bar turnaround.",
